SUMMARY:This Girl Laughs\, This Girl Cries\, This Girl Does Nothing
DESCRIPTION:This modern day fairy tale written by one of Australia’s este
 emed playwrights for young audiences\, revolves around three young sisters
  who are left in a forest by their woodcutter father and forced to find th
 eir own way in the world. From a classical beginning\, three resolutions a
 re made — one sister walks one way to find purpose\, one the other to fi
 nd adventure\, and the third stays right where she is to create a home. Th
 e three sisters traverse the globe in their unique ways to find themselves
  and heal.
